  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "kind": "observation",
   "text": "Процедура включает расчет Rwa, поиск минимального значения и сравнение с другими зонами.",
   "quote": "1. Calculate an apparent water resistivity (Rwa) from the porosity and uninvaded zone resistivity measurements.\n2. Look for the lowest value of Rwa in a porous and permeable zone and compare it to the values of Rwa calculated in the other zones.",
